{
  "key": 29762,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_GiratinaIsUpAhead",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is it...\n",
        "GIRATINA is up ahead.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_YouWereAlreadyHere",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: ...So, you were already\n",
        "here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_WhyChangeTheWorld",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Why do you seek to\n",
        "destroy the world?\r",
        "If you hate our world, you should\n",
        "just go off somewhere alone.\r",
        "Find somewhere where you can live\n",
        "without seeing others.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_ThatsNoJustice",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: You aim to remove\n",
        "suffering But you will remove joy\r",
        "as well.\r",
        "Your suicidal nihilism will not\n",
        "save people.\r",
        "You are drowning and trying to\n",
        "take the rest of us down with you.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_ThatIsMyJustice",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I do not hate this world.\n",
        "I simply see what it could be.\r",
        "Others will thank me. They will\n",
        "thank me for creating a new world\r",
        "without suffering.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_IWontLose",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I won’t lose!\r",
        "I will acquire GIRATINA’s power\n",
        "for myself!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_YoullDestroyThisWorld",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...Don’t think that you can\n",
        "defeat or capture that Pokémon.\r",
        "This bizarre world is none other\n",
        "than that Pokémon itself!\r",
        "Capturing it or defeating it will\n",
        "make this world disappear and our\r",
        "world with it!\r",
        "Go on, destroy it for me!\r",
        "Do it.\n",
        "Inherit my legacy.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_DontBelieveHisLies",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Make GIRATINA understand\n",
        "our feelings.\r",
        "I’m sure it will help. It is a\n",
        "kind Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_CynthiaFullyHealedPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia fully healed {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s\n",
        "Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_LetsGoMeetGiratina",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Now let’s go meet\n",
        "GIRATINA!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_GiratinaIsEnraged",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: GIRATINA is enraged\n",
        "because the two worlds are\r",
        "endangered.\r",
        "It has merged the Distortion World\n",
        "and our world at the Spear Pillar.\r",
        "That’s why both worlds are\n",
        "becoming distorted.\r",
        "If it continues both worlds will\n",
        "be destroyed!\r",
        "If you defeat GIRATINA and show\n",
        "the tight bond you share with your\r",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "GIRATINA will understand.\r",
        "The distortion of the two worlds\n",
        "will stop!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_YourBondIsStrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: I know that the bond you\n",
        "share with your Pokémon is strong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DistortionWorldB7F_Text_Dummy12",
      "garbage": 7
    }
  ]
}
